</style><nav class="vm-breadcrumbs" style="--breadcrumb-separator: '-'; --breadcrumbs-link-color: #0076C0; --breadcrumbs-active-color: #000000; --breadcrumbs-separator-color: #7F7F7F;"><div class="container"><ol class="vm-breadcrumbs__list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList"><li class="vm-breadcrumbs__item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/homepage" itemprop="item" class="vm-breadcrumbs__link"><span itemprop="name">Home</span><meta itemprop="position" content="1" /></a></li><li class="vm-breadcrumbs__item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/de-club" class="vm-breadcrumbs__link" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">De club</span><meta itemprop="position" content="1" /></a></li><li class="vm-breadcrumbs__item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/de-club/supporters" class="vm-breadcrumbs__link" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Supporters</span><meta itemprop="position" content="2" /></a></li><li class="vm-breadcrumbs__item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><span class="vm-breadcrumbs__text vm-breadcrumbs__text--active" itemprop="name">Jouw route naar het BUKO Stadion</span><meta itemprop="position" content="3" /></li></ol></div></nav><section class="AdvancedGrid AdvancedGrid--3133 ContrastBgColor universal-box-padding-sides universal-box-padding-top-bot" style="--Height: 60px;"><article class='AdvancedGrid__container AdvancedGrid__container--'><section class='AdvancedGrid__column AdvancedGrid__column--8617 ' style='padding: var(--Padding);'><div class='AdvancedGrid__row AdvancedGrid__row--9210 '><style>@media screen and (min-width: 991px) {
.cta-paragraph__container--21390 {
height: auto !important;
}
}
</style><section class="cta-paragraph cta-paragraph--21390 config--203 bg-grote-titel  no-repeat center-center bg-cover no-padding "  style="background-color: transparent; " data-paragraphid="21390" id="21390" data-aos="" data-aos-duration="0"><div class="cta-paragraph__container cta-paragraph__container--21390 container  image-left "><style>.cta-paragraph--21390 .cta-paragraph__content {
}
.cta-paragraph--21390 .cta-paragraph__image-container {
}
</style><figure class="cta-paragraph__image-container  center center" style="" data-aos="" data-aos-duration="0"><picture class="cta-paragraph__image bg-cover "><source media="(max-width: 400px)" srcset="/Admin/Public/GetImage.ashx?Image=/Files/Images/05-De-club/buko_route.jpg&x=-4&y=28&Crop=7&Format=webp&Quality=90&Compression=80&Width=400"><source media="(max-width: 994px)" srcset="/Admin/Public/GetImage.ashx?Image=/Files/Images/05-De-club/buko_route.jpg&x=-4&y=28&Crop=7&Format=webp&Quality=90&Compression=80&Width=994"><img src="/Admin/Public/GetImage.ashx?Image=/Files/Images/05-De-club/buko_route.jpg&x=-4&y=28&Crop=7&Format=webp&Quality=90&Compression=80&Width=600" loading="lazy" alt="Entree van het BUKO Stadion met gevel en groot SC Telstar-logo in Velsen-Zuid" class="cta-paragraph__image bg-cover " width="1980" height="500"></picture></figure><section class="cta-paragraph__content cta-paragraph__content--21390  " data-aos="" data-aos-duration="0"><article class="cta-paragraph__content-container "><header class="cta-paragraph__header text-center"><h2 class="cta-paragraph__header">Route naar het BUKO Stadion</h2></header><div class="cta-paragraph__text text-center"><div class="cta-paragraph__text "><p><strong>Vanuit de richting Amsterdam/Haarlem</strong><br />Neem de A9 richting Alkmaar en sla bij afslag IJmuiden af. Volg de N202 richting IJmuiden en volg daarna de borden naar het BUKO Stadion.</p>
<p><strong>Vanuit de richting Alkmaar/Beverwijk</strong><br />Volg de A22 richting IJmuiden. Neem afslag IJmuiden en volg de N208 en N202 tot je de borden naar het BUKO Stadion ziet.</p>
<p><strong>Vanuit de richting Zaandam/Purmerend</strong><br />Volg de A8 en daarna de A9 richting Haarlem. Neem afslag IJmuiden en volg de N202 richting het stadion.</p>
<p>Volg bij aankomst altijd de instructies van de verkeersregelaars.</p></div></div><nav class="cta-paragraph__btn-navigation text-center"><a href='https://9292.nl/' class='btn default-btn btn--1857 primary-btn AdvancedGridButton' target='_self' ><span class='btn__text cta-paragraph__btn cta-paragraph__btn-label'>PLAN HIER EENVOUDIG JOUW ROUTE</span></a></nav></article></section></div></section></div></section></article><!--// Generate Buttons //--></section><style>.AdvancedGrid--3133 .AdvancedGrid__row {
--VerticalAlign: center;
--HorinzontalAlign: center;
align-items: var(--VerticalAlign);
justify-content: var(--HorinzontalAlign);
